### Gauge — abs

Use this pattern for values recorded as an absolute value — such as a
configuration value or a device setpoint. Prometheus `Gauge` maps to the
OpenTelemetry `Gauge` instrument.

{{< tabpane text=true >}} {{% tab Java %}}

